select m.id, 3, $gfx$blackout-rule$gfx$, $gfx$Ang Blackout Rule: 60 min Bago hanggang 30 min Pagkatapos$gfx$, $gfx$Walang bagong entry sa blackout window. FOMC day = walang NY entry.$gfx$, $gfx$Rule: walang bagong entry mula 60 minutes bago hanggang 30 minutes pagkatapos ng high-impact USD event.

Halimbawa: NFP 9:30 PM PHT kapag US winter (EST), blackout 8:30 PM hanggang 10:00 PM PHT. Kapag US daylight time (EDT), NFP 8:30 PM PHT, blackout 7:30 PM hanggang 9:00 PM PHT. Sinusunod nito ang New York local time (DST).

FOMC day: walang NY entry sa buong NY session.

Pagkatapos ng blackout, hindi automatic ang entry. Normal Shared Rules ulit: bagong structure at confirmation.

Paalala: start small sa cents account gamit ang maliit na real money na kaya mong mawala. Max 1% risk per trade, at laging may stop loss. Education lang, not financial advice.$gfx$, $gfx$Blackout = walang bagong entry.$gfx$, $gfx$Isulat ang blackout windows sa susunod na 2 linggo.$gfx$, $gfx$draft$gfx$
