insert into public.training_lessons (module_id, sort, slug, title, tldr, body_md, takeaway, practice_task, status)
select m.id, 4, $gfx$when-there-is-no-orb$gfx$, $gfx$Kailan Walang ORB$gfx$, $gfx$News, sobrang lapad na range, o high volatility = walang ORB.$gfx$, $gfx$News: kung may high-impact USD news sa blackout window (60 min bago hanggang 30 min pagkatapos), walang ORB.

Lapad: kung ang range o kinakailangang SL ay lampas 1.5x H1 ATR, skip. Halimbawa, 30-min range na $25 at H1 ATR na $12: 1.5 × $12 = $18, kaya skip.

Volatility: kung ang current H1 range ay higit 2x ng average ng huling 20 H1 candles, walang bagong entry.

Ang pag-skip ay bahagi ng system. Hindi ito missed opportunity.

Paalala: start small sa cents account gamit ang maliit na real money na kaya mong mawala. Max 1% risk per trade, at laging may stop loss. Education lang, not financial advice.$gfx$, $gfx$Skip ay valid na desisyon.$gfx$, $gfx$Sa backtest mo, bilangin kung ilang opens ang dapat ni-skip.$gfx$, $gfx$draft$gfx$
