insert into public.training_lessons (module_id, sort, slug, title, tldr, body_md, takeaway, practice_task, status)
select m.id, 5, $gfx$killzones-pht$gfx$, $gfx$Killzones: London at NY Windows (PHT)$gfx$, $gfx$Ang killzones ay mga oras na madalas mas aktibo ang Gold. Timing context lang ito: hindi entry rule at hindi kapalit ng entry conditions ng Shared Rules.$gfx$, $gfx$Oras sa PHT. Asian range (GFX convention): 8:00 AM hanggang 2:00 PM PHT buong taon. London open (8:00 AM London time): 4:00 PM PHT kapag winter sa UK (GMT), 3:00 PM PHT kapag UK summer time (BST, mula last Sunday ng March hanggang last Sunday ng October). NY open (8:00 AM New York time): 9:00 PM PHT kapag winter sa US (EST), 8:00 PM PHT kapag US daylight time (EDT, mula second Sunday ng March hanggang first Sunday ng November). Sinusunod nito ang local time ng London at New York (DST). May mga 2-3 linggo bawat taon na magkaiba ang DST ng UK at US (mid/late March at late Oct hanggang early Nov); sa mga linggong iyon, 8:00 PM PHT ang NY open pero 4:00 PM PHT pa rin ang London open.

London killzone (timing context lang): humigit-kumulang 4:00-7:00 PM PHT kapag UK winter, 3:00-6:00 PM PHT kapag UK summer time. NY killzone (timing context lang): humigit-kumulang 8:00-11:00 PM PHT kapag US winter, 7:00-10:00 PM PHT kapag US daylight time.

Kahit nasa killzone, susundin pa rin ang news blackout at high volatility filter.

Note: ito ay concept na itinuturo para sa context, hindi standalone na dahilan para mag-entry.

Paalala: start small sa cents account gamit ang maliit na real money na kaya mong mawala. Max 1% risk per trade, at laging may stop loss. Education lang, not financial advice.$gfx$, $gfx$Killzone = timing context, hindi entry rule.$gfx$, $gfx$Isulat ang London at NY killzones sa PHT para sa kasalukuyang buwan.$gfx$, $gfx$draft$gfx$
from public.training_modules m join public.training_courses c on c.id = m.course_id where c.slug = $gfx$gold-advanced-setups$gfx$ and m.slug = $gfx$smc-ict$gfx$
on conflict (module_id, slug) do update set sort = excluded.sort, title = excluded.title, tldr = excluded.tldr, body_md = excluded.body_md, takeaway = excluded.takeaway, practice_task = excluded.practice_task, status = excluded.status;

