select m.id, 3, $gfx$fib-confluence-setup$gfx$, $gfx$Fib + Zone + EMA Confluence$gfx$, $gfx$Ang buong Fib setup: impulse, pullback sa golden zone na may structure, tapos confirmation.$gfx$, $gfx$Entry conditions: H4 trend at malinaw na H1 impulse leg. Pullback sa 0.5-0.618 na tumatama sa S/R flip o demand/supply. M15 o H1 confirmation sa direction ng trend.

