Target: swing high o low ng impulse bilang first logical target. Min 1:2.

Paalala: start small sa cents account gamit ang maliit na real money na kaya mong mawala. Max 1% risk per trade, at laging may stop loss. Education lang, not financial advice.$gfx$, $gfx$Fib + structure + confirmation.$gfx$, $gfx$Isulat ang full plan para sa 3 Fib confluence setups sa chart replay.$gfx$, $gfx$draft$gfx$
